        },
        {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the payment options available?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we offer Cash on Delivery (COD) on selected products.</p><p>COD is available only for our Ready-to-Ship Products that are currently in stock. These products can be dispatched immediately after your order is placed.</p><p>However, Made-to-Order or Custom Products are specially manufactured after an order is received. Therefore, COD is not available for these items, and prepaid payment is required to confirm the order.</p><p>If you're unsure whether a product is eligible for COD, please contact our support team before placing your order.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>The ideal way to track your order is to sign-up at furnisquare.com and then visit the order tracking page. Or, as a guest, you can visit the Order Status page and your Email address or phone number linked with the order. Here, you can check the details pertaining to your order, such as Order confirmation, Manufacturing progress, Quality check and dispatch details. We always try our best to deliver the product within the specified or communicated time limit. We also proactively get in touch with the customer, either through electronic means or through calls, to notify them about the status of their product and where it is in transit. If, in a rare case, you haven’t received communication of any form from us after 10 days of placing an order, feel free to give us a call at our customer care number or drop an email at <a href=\"mailto:info@furnisquare.com\">info@furnisquare.com</a>.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the estimated time for a delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>Delivery times depend on the type of product you order:</p><ul><li>Ready-to-Ship Products: These are our regularly stocked products and are typically delivered within 7–10 business days.</li><li>Made-to-Order Products: Some of our products are custom-made only after an order is placed. Since these items are crafted specifically for you, delivery may take 25–30 days.</li></ul><p>If you have any questions about the delivery timeline for a specific product, please feel free to contact our support team.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are there any delivery or installation charges, or any hidden fees?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely not. Delivery of any product is free of charge for all orders in INDIA. We deliver across India, except for a few non-serviceable PIN codes. Before placing an order, you can enter your city’s or town’s PIN code in the box provided to check whether we deliver to your area or not. In certain exceptions, however, when we do agree to deliver the Products to the non-serviceable PIN codes, we may deliver the product to You, provided that the cost of transportation/delivery and installation is borne by you in advance. Also, the product will not be covered under any warranty.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
